<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle sees 1997 sales, profit growth.</title>
<headline>Nestle sees 1997 sales, profit growth.</headline>
<dateline>DAVOS, Switzerland 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nestle SA Chairman Helmut Maucher said he expected sales and profit to grow in 1997 and that profits should rise slightly faster than the average medium-term annual sales growth rate of seven to nine percent.</p>
<p>&quot;We are always very cautious in the beginning but I am pretty sure our sales and our profits will increase again in 1997 and probably a bit more than in 1996,&quot; Maucher told Reuters Financial Television at the World Economic Forum in Davos.</p>
</text>
